{"id":"59e4d0955d71de93","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-complete-development-residual-invariance.md","title":"完整发展后的残余不变性","display":"thm-complete-development-residual-invariance — 完整发展后的残余不变性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"theorem","label":"56-thm-complete-development-residual-invariance","aliases":["56-thm-complete-development-residual-invariance"],"display":"thm-complete-development-residual-invariance — 完整发展后的残余不变性","depends_on":["[[56-df-complete-development]]","[[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]","[[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]","[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]","[[56-thm-critical-pair-lemma]]","[[56-thm-newman-lemma]]"],"source_section":"§4.5 Proposition 4.5.6 (FD+)","source_printed_pages":"108","source_ocr_blocks":[129],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-complete-development-residual-invariance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-complete-development-residual-invariance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-complete-development-residual-invariance — 完整发展后的残余不变性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b06f8242a0a4824a\" href=\"?note=b06f8242a0a4824a\" title=\"56-df-complete-development\">56-df-complete-development</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06c0295d39a97a66\" href=\"?note=06c0295d39a97a66\" title=\"56-thm-complete-development-unique\">56-thm-complete-development-unique</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fec2299959a8e3bb\" href=\"?note=fec2299959a8e3bb\" title=\"56-df-reduction-residual-transport\">56-df-reduction-residual-transport</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4634b959eefaa45b\" href=\"?note=4634b959eefaa45b\" title=\"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation\">56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dcc1e9c43059f569\" href=\"?note=dcc1e9c43059f569\" title=\"56-thm-critical-pair-lemma\">56-thm-critical-pair-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" href=\"?note=edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" title=\"56-thm-newman-lemma\">56-thm-newman-lemma</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.5 Proposition 4.5.6 (FD+)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"108"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>129</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为正交TRS，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,B\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(U,B\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=s\">\\(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=s\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>完整发展和唯一目标见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b06f8242a0a4824a\" href=\"?note=b06f8242a0a4824a\" title=\"56-df-complete-development\">56-df-complete-development</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"06c0295d39a97a66\" href=\"?note=06c0295d39a97a66\" title=\"56-thm-complete-development-unique\">56-thm-complete-development-unique</a>；残余传送及同位置规则唯一见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fec2299959a8e3bb\" href=\"?note=fec2299959a8e3bb\" title=\"56-df-reduction-residual-transport\">56-df-reduction-residual-transport</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4634b959eefaa45b\" href=\"?note=4634b959eefaa45b\" title=\"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation\">56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation</a>。</li>\n<li>标记系统的局部合流及Newman推导采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"dcc1e9c43059f569\" href=\"?note=dcc1e9c43059f569\" title=\"56-thm-critical-pair-lemma\">56-thm-critical-pair-lemma</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" href=\"?note=edc2d7f4ffe88f2e\" title=\"56-thm-newman-lemma\">56-thm-newman-lemma</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\n\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho,U)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\eta,U)\n\\right)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,B)=\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\eta,B)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\n\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho,U)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\eta,U)\n\\right)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,B)=\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\eta,B)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>沿用 FD! 证明的带线源项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\underline s_U\">\\(\\underline s_U\\)</span>，再给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 中各 redex 的头加独立蓝色标签。蓝色标签与下划线是两个独立比特，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\cap B\">\\(U\\cap B\\)</span> 的头可同时具有两个标记。只允许收缩下划线头；收缩消耗该头的全部标记，变量像中的蓝色标记连同变量像复制或删除，外围标记保持。没有新蓝色头。按单步残余四类归纳，当前蓝色 redex 集恰是初始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的当前残余；规则身份保持。</p>\n<p>再说明独立颜色不会给证明偷加假设。正交性保证不同 redex 头不落在另一 redex 的非变量真模式中；因此所有非根蓝色头都由模式变量像承载。允许带线根自身同时有/无蓝色的两种规则版本，收缩都消耗其根色。两版本的左根色不同，不能互相合一；其他非平凡规则重叠擦除颜色和下划线即得到原系统的非平凡重叠。左线性保持。临界对引理给带色带线系统局部合流，FD的下划线测度忽略蓝色仍严格下降，Newman引理给相应可达集合合流。因此同一带色源项的所有完全消线正规形相同。</p>\n<p>两个完整发展 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\eta\">\\(\\rho,\\eta\\)</span> 提升到这个同一源项，所得唯一正规形既给出同一个擦色目标项，也给出同一组蓝色位置。在该共同目标中，同位置规则唯一，所以相同蓝色位置给相同的带规则身份红项集，正是两边的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}_R(-,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Res}_R(-,B)\\)</span>。这比只有目标项唯一更强；未把二者混为一事。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\varnothing\">\\(U=\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\varnothing\">\\(B=\\varnothing\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(U\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 均由独立标记处理。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese (2003), Proposition 4.5.6 (FD+)；已读其蓝色标记证明，并按本地带规则身份的残余编码补齐颜色/下划线及规则身份的对应。未建立第8章 proof-term residual 的严格cube identity，未作机器证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-complete-development","status":"resolved","id":"b06f8242a0a4824a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-complete-development]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-complete-development-unique","status":"resolved","id":"06c0295d39a97a66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-residual-transport","status":"resolved","id":"fec2299959a8e3bb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"4634b959eefaa45b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-critical-pair-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"dcc1e9c43059f569","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-critical-pair-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-newman-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"edc2d7f4ffe88f2e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-newman-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-complete-development","status":"resolved","id":"b06f8242a0a4824a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"完整发展和唯一目标见 [[56-df-complete-development]]、[[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]；残余传送及同位置规则唯一见 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]、[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-complete-development-unique","status":"resolved","id":"06c0295d39a97a66","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"完整发展和唯一目标见 [[56-df-complete-development]]、[[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]；残余传送及同位置规则唯一见 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]、[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-residual-transport","status":"resolved","id":"fec2299959a8e3bb","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"完整发展和唯一目标见 [[56-df-complete-development]]、[[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]；残余传送及同位置规则唯一见 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]、[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"4634b959eefaa45b","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"完整发展和唯一目标见 [[56-df-complete-development]]、[[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]；残余传送及同位置规则唯一见 [[56-df-reduction-residual-transport]]、[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-critical-pair-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"dcc1e9c43059f569","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"标记系统的局部合流及Newman推导采用 [[56-thm-critical-pair-lemma]]、[[56-thm-newman-lemma]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-newman-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"edc2d7f4ffe88f2e","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"标记系统的局部合流及Newman推导采用 [[56-thm-critical-pair-lemma]]、[[56-thm-newman-lemma]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"U,B\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)=s","display":false},{"tex":"\\left(\n\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\rho,U)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{CDev}_R(\\eta,U)\n\\right)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\rho,B)=\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\eta,B)\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\underline s_U","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"U\\cap B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho,\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Res}_R(-,B)","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"B=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"U\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":3490,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-complete-development-residual-invariance.md]]"},{"id":"5d7d7db404fca095","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CDev}_R$ 见 [[56-df-complete-development]]；完整发展的存在唯一目标与残余不变性见 [[56-thm-complete-development-unique]]、[[56-thm-complete-development-residual-invariance]]。"}],"outgoing":["b06f8242a0a4824a","06c0295d39a97a66","fec2299959a8e3bb","4634b959eefaa45b","dcc1e9c43059f569","edc2d7f4ffe88f2e"]}